            "review_title": "Review at Vesou Saigon",
            "review_text": "Lien P\n11 contributions\n0\nBest daiquiri in Saigon\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nI've been coming back to this cozy bar too many times! Love the elegant interiors, and the wonderful rum-based cocktails they serve up. Let them know what you're looking for, and they will have the best recommendations for you whether it is a classic or a more complex bespoke cocktail. My personal favorite is a daiquiri with Clairin Sonson. \n\nThe food menu is also not to be missed. Make plans to go before dinner to enjoy some lovely appetizers like the hummus nduja with good sourdough.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThey can offer a great spin on any classics. Try their rum-based negroni, martini, or pick a bottle for rum classics like daiquiri.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2025\nRémy P\nThank you Lien ! We're so glad to be your go-to spot in Saigon! It means a lot to know you enjoy both our cocktails and our food. We'll be ready with your favorite Clairin Sonson Daiquiri next time you visit!\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
