            "review_title": "Review at Vesou Saigon",
            "review_text": "Nga P\n5 contributions\n0\nThe best Rum Bar - Sipping and Cocktail in town\nNov 2024 • Friends\nThis is a great spot to have a sip with friends in the midst of Saigon. Very close to center. The entrance is interesting, going down to a beautiful, cosy, yet spacious basement. The staff is very dedicated to their drinks, very tasty and fit the mood. Highly recommend those locals and tourists if you want to discover Vietnamese products.\nInsider tip:\nBetter to look up to find the signage then pay attention to find the door to go down. Very interesting journey.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2025\nRémy P\nThank you for your wonderful review! We're happy you enjoyed the atmosphere, our cocktails, and the chance to explore Vietnamese products. We look forward to welcoming you and your friends again soon!\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
